  "notes": "Piano solo on ONE grand staff (brace). A correct conversion yields exactly ONE part \"Piano\" with 2 staves; it must NOT be split into right/left hand parts, and the second right-hand voice in bars 13-16 must stay inside the piano part (voice 2), not become a new part. DAMAGE (spread): 2-up double-page spread: a text-only facing page (verso, \"Notes on the Music\", no music) on the left and the music page (recto) on the right, as ONE landscape image. The app must find the music on the right half and ignore the prose page. scan adds curl towards the gutter and 1 deg rotation; severe adds 3.5 deg rotation, perspective, aged paper (RGB). TRUTH LIMITATIONS: The facing page is prose only; its text is not part of the truth (no lyrics, no title)."
